From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: blizz <b@x>
Date: Mon, 9 Nov 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Warcraft III: store its keys (products 14 and 18) where its
 scripts put them

1.0 to 1.27 read the keys from font\font.gid (war3.mpq) and font\font.exp (War3x.mpq); without them the game stops with
"Warcraft III was unable to find a CD Key".
---
 src/installer.zig | 6 ++++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/src/installer.zig b/src/installer.zig
index 7ae945f..17ac49f 100644
--- a/src/installer.zig
+++ b/src/installer.zig
@@ -99,6 +99,11 @@ pub const Secrets = struct {
             // StarCraft's own key (its script's product 23): StarCraft opens the font\font.gid it's
             // written into at start, and stops with "unable to open a required file" without it.
             23 => self.classic,
+            // Warcraft III's keys (its scripts' products 14 and 18, cdkey26): the game opens the font\font.gid (Reign of Chaos,
+            // in war3.mpq) and font\font.exp (The Frozen Throne, in War3x.mpq) they are written into at start, and stops with
+            // "Warcraft III was unable to find a CD Key" without them.
+            14 => self.classic,
+            18 => self.expansion,
             else => null,
         };
     }
